        "Route planning and dispatching tool helps field businesses organize where teams need to go and who should handle each stop. It also keeps the information needed to complete the visit close to the work. Route planning arranges leads, customers, inspections, jobs, and repeat service stops. Dispatching assigns those stops to a representative, technician, or crew and keeps the schedule visible to the office and field.",
      inDefinedTermSet: { "@id": "https://knockio.com/#website" },
    },
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      "@id":
        "https://knockio.com/features/route-planning-and-dispatching/#stop-types",
      name: "Stop types Knockio can route and dispatch",
      itemListElement: [
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Leads" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "Customers" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 3, name: "Inspections" },
