            gap between the route, the calendar, and whoever is deciding who
            goes where. When those three things live in separate tools, a single
            change — a cancellation, a sick technician, or a job that runs long
            — means someone has to manually update a map, a calendar, and a CRM,
            in that order, before the next crew even knows their day changed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1380px] gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-8">
